  "notes": "A versatile ichidan verb with distinct meanings depending on context.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Sense 1 (refrain): {他動詞|たどうし} (transitive) — Xを{控|ひか}える\n- Senses 2-3 (wait/be imminent): {自動詞|じどうし} (intransitive)\n\nASPECT (ている):\n- {控|ひか}えている with sense 1: ongoing restraint\n- {控|ひか}えている with sense 3: something is approaching ({試験|しけん}を{控|ひか}えている = an exam is coming up)\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- Xを{控|ひか}える: to refrain from X, to cut back on X\n- 〜を{控|ひか}えている: to have ~ coming up\n- {控|ひか}え{室|しつ}: waiting room, green room\n- {控|ひか}えめ: modest, reserved, restrained\n\nNote: {控|ひか}えめ (na-adjective/noun) is very common and describes restraint in manner, volume, or quantity.",
